caption: Blessing of Blood and Birth
setting-component: blessing-of-blood-and-birth

A woman who completes a valid Blood Moon sacrifice gains Niktul’s protection over her next four pregnancies.

For each of those pregnancies, she is guaranteed a healthy baby and an easy childbirth. The blessing is intended to prevent ordinary biological failure in pregnancy and delivery. Exact boundaries against external violence, hostile magic, starvation, deliberate injury, and other extraordinary interference remain to be defined.

The four protected pregnancies are tied to the woman who personally made the sacrifice; another person cannot hunt on her behalf to obtain the blessing for her.
